        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-17T12:31:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>morph147 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Best part of a Cubs win is knowing that we knocked the cardinals out of the post season\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nYes!Look, GtGs people and others, I get it, you have perfectly valid reasons for liking the Cardinals, but, I just, can't relate.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm with you. &nbsp;The Cardinals need to go away and let some other team have the stage. &nbsp;They earned their time, but dang I'll root for anyone (Even the stinking Cubs) if it means I don't hear a word about the \"Cardinal way\" for a few months.</p>",
