        "created_at": "2015-10-22T00:16:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can't get too upset about the Cardinal fans, after all Steelers fans are pretty obnoxious about their franchise being better than everyone else. &nbsp;(I mean it is, obviously, but you don't have to rub it in everyone's faces)</p><p>I need to make some Pirate cards for bottom of the ninth when ever that comes out. &nbsp;I'm dying here waiting for it. &nbsp;Literally dying, every second my life is ticking away and still no Bottom of the Ninth.</p><p>BTW, what kind of bonuses would you give for wearing burning candles in your beard?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>P.S. &nbsp;That XKCD is one of my favorites.</p>",
